WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.485
YouTube gives existing campaign footage another release path.

2
00:00:05.485 --> 00:00:09.290
It extends each shoot without starting a new production.

3
00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:14.440
AI helpers prepare a main film, Shorts, titles and thumbnails.

4
00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:18.690
A person approves the package before it is scheduled.

5
00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:22.840
Results return to the dashboard to guide the next release.
